 ```
 
+Months accept `month`, `months`, and `mo` (case-insensitive). A month is a fixed
+duration of one twelfth of a 365.25-day year: 30.4375 days, or 2,629,800,000
+milliseconds. The unit `m` means minutes. Number-to-string formatting continues
+to express month-sized durations in days.
